<title>SPAIN: Aumar to name Enrigue Duran chairman.</title>
<headline>Aumar to name Enrigue Duran chairman.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish motorway toll firm Autopistas del Mare Nostrum (Aumar) is to name Enrique Duran chairman following its June 25 shareholders' meeting, construction group Dragados said on Friday.</p>
<p>Duran is also deputy-chairman at Dragados, which has a 25 percent majority stake in Aumar.</p>
<p>Duran will replace Jose Luis Ceron at Aumar.</p>
<p>Dragados has today named Eloy Dominguez-Adame chief executive, who will also be named deputy-chairman of Aumar at the June 25 meeting.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
